{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_3","type":"agent_message","text":"The fixed harness preserves the explored overlap and compares two states separated by a fully serviced tick cycle. It records nested protocol and storage fields, pending callbacks, queues and caller policy. The comparison excludes logging, storage read counters and unlocked mutex state. It also records whether work drained after each round and whether the cycle carried only heartbeat traffic; the later proposal remains a separate diagnostic.\n"}}
{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"cat > prepare_check.py <<'PY'\nimport json\nbind=['bind_auto_exit','bind_transfer_abort']\ndef cmp(field,value=None,reference=None):\n d={'field':field,'op':'eq'}\n if reference is not None:d['reference']=reference\n else:d['value']=value\n return d\nss=['s_joint_contract','s_auto_ownership','s_conf_contract','s_applied','s_abort','s_ticks_roles','s_proposal_read','s_apply_completion']\nlegality={'source_ids':['s_raw_init','s_init','s_usage','s_ready_contract','s_apply_completion','s_node_contract','s_memory_initial','s_memory_snapshot','s_memory_append','s_transfer_api','s_transfer','s_ticks_roles','s_config','s_raw_state','s_log_state','s_progress_state','s_inflight_state','s_determinism'],'expectation_ids':['s_ready_contract','s_node_contract','s_joint_contract','s_auto_ownership'],'binding_ids':bind,'derivation':'Uses actual NewRawNode initialization from an agreed snapshot (index/term 1, voters 1/2/3) and matching HardState, as supported by RawNode initialization guidance. Campaign, proposals, transfer, all replication and membership application execute real target code. The caller serializes all calls, persists each Ready snapshot/entries/HardState before any outbound delivery, applies committed entries and configurations before Advance, and drains Ready/network work after each tick round. TransferLeader is called after commitment and before applying that Ready configuration, without accepting another Ready; entry persistence has already completed. Exactly the first implementation-generated TimeoutNow is dropped; every subsequent message is delivered, and all nodes receive ticks. MemoryStorage substitutes completed durable writes in a no-crash execution. RawNode starts no goroutine and needs no Stop. No existing test helper or private protocol write is used.','applicability':'Principal input is overlap=true and an implicit removal of node 3, retaining voters 1 and 2. The identical no-transfer case is an independently selected diagnostic control, not a second formal requirement. Admission requires actual joint application, transfer active, one loss and drained work. Later proposal rescue occurs strictly after the compared suffix.','unresolved':[],'conflicts':[],'alternatives':['Read-only reflection captures live target state into independent JSON strings. It excludes only logger/traceLogger, MemoryStorage.callStats and MemoryStorage.Mutex; no protocol bookkeeping is omitted. Slice capacity and allocation addresses are not logical state; objects are not replaced during the heartbeat-only suffix.','Global election randomness is not sampled during the selected suffix: messages must all be heartbeat/response, role remains leader, all state including follower election counters and randomized timeouts is compared, and source tick/reset paths govern any election. If these conditions do not hold, cycle_closed is false and no recurrence violation is claimed.']}\nground={'source_ids':ss+['s_raw_state','s_log_state','s_progress_state','s_inflight_state','s_determinism','s_memory_initial','s_memory_append','s_memory_snapshot'],'expectation_ids':['s_joint_contract','s_conf_contract','s_auto_ownership'],'binding_ids':bind,'derivation':'Under claim_auto_joint_continuation, an implicit joint configuration whose transfer blocker has cleared cannot remain in a closed recurrent suffix of reliable ticks and serviced work while AutoLeave remains true. The monitor compares a measured repeatable-cycle condition against the actual live AutoLeave state. cycle_closed requires equality of recursively captured protocol/storage/caller states, drained work after every round, heartbeat-only delivered traffic and stable leadership. The trace and before/after strings are retained for correspondence review. The deterministic suffix is ten Tick-all-nodes-and-drain rounds; its size is a witness period, not an exit deadline. No additional input is needed to repeat this suffix.','applicability':'Only overlap=true is formally selected, before outcomes are known. Result correlates to the admitted applied change by case_id and config_index, with a separately witnessed clear-transfer starting point. A failed recurrence condition is only absence of this witness, not proof of eventual exit.','unresolved':[],'conflicts':[],'alternatives':['No-transfer exit and later proposal-triggered exit are retained diagnostics and cannot suppress a violating recurrent witness.','A finite period alone supplies no liveness deadline; the result depends on state closure and complete trigger analysis.','No cluster safety or inability to commit ordinary work is claimed.']}\nplan={'description':'Fixed check of claim_auto_joint_continuation: actual three-node election and implicit joint removal, caught-up transfer overlapping leader application, one lost TimeoutNow, ten regular tick rounds clearing transfer, then a ten-round fully serviced suffix. Compare complete semantic state at suffix boundaries; retain no-transfer and post-observation proposal diagnostics.','claim_id':'claim_auto_joint_continuation','binding_ids':bind,'harness':{'kind':'go_test','source':'','files':{},'description':'Serialized RawNode network with synchronous MemoryStorage persistence and actual committed configuration application; read-only recursive state observation and no modified target code.','semantic_changes':['MemoryStorage represents durable completion without injecting crashes; application processing records configuration application and otherwise consumes normal entries.','A single emitted TimeoutNow is lost in the selected network policy; subsequent delivery is reliable.','Read-only reflection and JSON event reporting observe private protocol state; logging, storage call statistics and unlocked mutex internals are excluded from recurrence comparison.'],'prerequisites':[{'alias':'admitted','event':'admitted','conditions':[cmp('overlap',True),cmp('implicit',True),cmp('auto_leave',True),cmp('transfer',2),cmp('timeout_drops',1),cmp('drained',True)]},{'alias':'start','event':'cycle_start','conditions':[cmp('applied',reference='admitted.applied'),cmp('leader',True),cmp('transfer',0),cmp('timeout_drops',1),cmp('drained',True)]}],'legality':legality},'monitors':[{'id':'monitor_joint_cycle','checker_id':'joint_auto_exit_cycle','event':'cycle_result','binding_ids':bind,'grounding':ground,'applicability_conditions':[cmp('overlap',True)],'admission_alias':'admitted'}],'observable_properties':[{'checker_id':'joint_auto_exit_cycle','kind':'event_implication','trigger':cmp('event','cycle_result'),'antecedent':cmp('cycle_closed',True),'assertion':cmp('auto_leave',False),'identity_fields':['case_id','config_index'],'description':'A fully accounted recurrent suffix after the temporary transfer blocker clears must not retain the applied implicit joint AutoLeave state. Recurrence is measured from target/caller state, not inferred from a finite timeout. A nonclosed suffix only fails to exhibit this witness.'}],'uncertainties':['This single selected synchronous no-crash history does not cover async storage, restart or other configurations.','Formal violation attribution depends on semantic review of the state projection and deterministic repeated suffix; passing the Go test is not the oracle.','The diagnostic proposal intentionally introduces extra caller work after the observation; its recovery cannot satisfy the prior automatic-continuation duty.']}\njson.dump(plan,open('joint-exit-plan.json','w'),indent=2)\nsub={'action':'check','unit_id':'unit-claim_auto_joint_continuation','plan_path':'joint-exit-plan.json','harness_path':'joint_exit_fixed_test.go','rationale':'Construct a separately fixed event implication for the accepted automatic-exit obligation. Preserve the explored legal overlap, use complete state recurrence to avoid inventing a deadline, and retain control/rescue observations outside formal applicability.'}\njson.dump(sub,open('check-submission.json','w'),indent=2)\nPY\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python prepare_check.py\n/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/.venv/bin/python -I -B -c \\\"import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '/home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/src'); from consensus_assurance.cli import main; raise SystemExit(main())\\\" validate --run /home/nitro/Desktop/consensus-assurance/runs/2026-10-04_17-36-49-etcd_raft-real-run --submission check-submission.json\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
